WEBVTT

1
00:00:46.166 --> 00:00:47.833
In the previous verse, Lord Krishna

2
00:00:47.833 --> 00:00:49.500
explained about the instability

3
00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:52.625
and restlessness of the mind, and also

4
00:00:52.625 --> 00:00:54.083
clarified that

5
00:00:54.083 --> 00:00:55.500
it can be controlled

6
00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:58.250
through continuous practice.

7
00:00:58.250 --> 00:01:01.666
Now here he explains the pleasant results

8
00:01:01.666 --> 00:01:03.708
of this very process.

9
00:01:08.666 --> 00:01:09.833
These two verses

10
00:01:09.833 --> 00:01:13.041
describe the high state of a yogi

11
00:01:13.041 --> 00:01:14.125
who has gained

12
00:01:14.125 --> 00:01:17.250
complete control over their mind.

13
00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:20.375
Lord Krishna, in the twenty-seventh verse,

14
00:01:20.375 --> 00:01:24.291
uses the words sukham uttamam,
 meaning supreme happiness.

15
00:01:24.291 --> 00:01:26.708
A yogi whose mind is controlled

16
00:01:26.708 --> 00:01:29.125
attains this happiness.

17
00:01:29.125 --> 00:01:31.708
This bliss cannot be obtained 
from worldly things

18
00:01:31.708 --> 00:01:33.833
or from the senses.

19
00:01:33.833 --> 00:01:36.291
It only arises from inner peace

20
00:01:36.291 --> 00:01:39.708
and spiritual experience.

21
00:01:39.708 --> 00:01:42.750
Here the word prashānta manasa is also used,

22
00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:46.625
which indicates deep 
mental stability and peace.

23
00:01:46.625 --> 00:01:47.333
It's essential to understand

24
00:01:47.333 --> 00:01:48.291
that this peace is not due

25
00:01:48.291 --> 00:01:49.791
to absence of

26
00:01:49.791 --> 00:01:52.541
external commotion.

27
00:01:52.541 --> 00:01:55.166
Rather, it's the opposite.

28
00:01:55.166 --> 00:01:58.166
This is such a deep peace

29
00:01:58.166 --> 00:02:01.208
where even the noise of external material
 desires or cravings

30
00:02:01.208 --> 00:02:03.625
cannot disturb the mind.

31
00:02:03.625 --> 00:02:06.291
Lord Krishna further explains 
that this bliss is only possible

32
00:02:06.291 --> 00:02:10.041
when the yogi becomes shānta-rajasa,

33
00:02:10.041 --> 00:02:12.750
meaning when they have freed themselves

34
00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:15.666
from the influence of rajoguna.

35
00:02:15.666 --> 00:02:17.500
Rajoguna or rajas

36
00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:20.416
indicates desires and attractions.

37
00:02:20.416 --> 00:02:23.750
This is certainly superior to tamas,

38
00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:26.750
meaning ignorance and laziness,

39
00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:27.708
but this same rajoguna

40
00:02:27.708 --> 00:02:30.250
keeps a person entangled in
 the race for material pleasures,

41
00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:33.541
which creates stress and instability.

42
00:02:33.541 --> 00:02:35.250
But when a yogi

43
00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:37.458
calms desires too,

44
00:02:37.458 --> 00:02:39.708
they rise above rajoguna

45
00:02:39.708 --> 00:02:41.833
and become established in sattva guna.

46
00:02:41.833 --> 00:02:44.666
This is the best state,

47
00:02:44.666 --> 00:02:46.041
where there's neither ignorance of tamas

48
00:02:46.041 --> 00:02:49.375
nor bondage of rajas's desires.

49
00:02:49.375 --> 00:02:52.458
Lord Krishna further explains

50
00:02:52.458 --> 00:02:54.083
that such a yogi becomes brahma-bhūta,

51
00:02:54.083 --> 00:02:54.791
meaning

52
00:02:54.791 --> 00:02:55.500
they know themselves

53
00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:58.375
as an eternal soul –

54
00:02:58.375 --> 00:03:01.916
that soul which is beyond body and mind.

55
00:03:01.916 --> 00:03:04.708
Becoming free from material attachments,

56
00:03:04.708 --> 00:03:07.416
this soul can recognize its true form –

57
00:03:07.416 --> 00:03:10.166
that form which is infinite, imperishable.

58
00:03:10.166 --> 00:03:12.000
In such a case, the soul automatically

59
00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:14.666
experiences supreme bliss.

60
00:03:14.666 --> 00:03:17.250
This is the realization of complete freedom,

61
00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:19.208
because now the yogi

62
00:03:19.208 --> 00:03:21.458
has become free from karmic bondages too.

63
00:03:21.458 --> 00:03:23.875
Where attachment doesn't remain,

64
00:03:23.875 --> 00:03:26.000
there's no bondage of karma either.

65
00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:29.708
Whether it's karma of this birth or past births,

66
00:03:29.708 --> 00:03:32.791
now they have no effect on the yogi.

67
00:03:32.791 --> 00:03:34.833
Then in the twenty-eighth verse,

68
00:03:34.833 --> 00:03:37.583
Lord Krishna explains in detail

69
00:03:37.583 --> 00:03:40.583
the continuous practice of yoga and its effect.

70
00:03:40.583 --> 00:03:42.208
In yoga practice,

71
00:03:42.208 --> 00:03:45.083
it's essential to keep the 
mind focused continuously.

72
00:03:45.083 --> 00:03:48.416
Even if the mind wanders, it 
must be stabilized again and again 

73
00:03:48.416 --> 00:03:51.291
in contemplation of the soul and Paramātmā.

74
00:03:51.291 --> 00:03:53.875
Lord Krishna calls this brahma-sansparśam,

75
00:03:53.875 --> 00:03:56.666
meaning direct contact with Brahman.

76
00:03:56.666 --> 00:03:59.541
This is not some verbal or
 intellectual understanding,

77
00:03:59.541 --> 00:04:03.000
but a direct spiritual experience.

78
00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:04.708
From this contact with Brahman,

79
00:04:04.708 --> 00:04:07.250
the yogi attains sukham-atyantam,

80
00:04:07.250 --> 00:04:08.500
meaning supreme

81
00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:11.000
and infinite bliss.

82
00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:12.083
This bliss is many times

83
00:04:12.083 --> 00:04:15.083
superior to any worldly pleasure.

84
00:04:15.083 --> 00:04:17.625
Worldly pleasures are momentary,

85
00:04:17.625 --> 00:04:19.125
will vanish,

86
00:04:19.125 --> 00:04:22.125
but this spiritual bliss

87
00:04:22.125 --> 00:04:26.333
settles permanently within a yogi.

88
00:04:31.083 --> 00:04:34.041
When the mind becomes calm,

89
00:04:34.041 --> 00:04:36.625
when it stops running after cravings

90
00:04:36.625 --> 00:04:40.458
all the time,

91
00:04:40.458 --> 00:04:43.000
only then does real happiness

92
00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:46.458
arise within a person.

93
00:04:46.458 --> 00:04:49.125
Remember, whatever happiness is obtained

94
00:04:49.125 --> 00:04:51.625
from material desires

95
00:04:51.625 --> 00:04:53.750
is all momentary.

96
00:04:53.750 --> 00:04:56.500
This happiness is here today,

97
00:04:56.500 --> 00:04:58.291
not tomorrow.

98
00:04:58.291 --> 00:05:01.666
The mind will always force you

99
00:05:01.666 --> 00:05:05.458
to run after new attractions by showing them –

100
00:05:05.458 --> 00:05:07.291
sometimes after some object,

101
00:05:07.291 --> 00:05:10.458
sometimes after some success.

102
00:05:10.458 --> 00:05:13.000
You certainly think

103
00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:16.833
that attaining all this will satisfy the mind,

104
00:05:16.833 --> 00:05:21.208
but this satisfaction never lasts.

105
00:05:21.208 --> 00:05:24.750
True satisfaction and true bliss

106
00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:29.791
can only be given by a calm mind.

107
00:05:29.791 --> 00:05:31.916
And this peace will come

108
00:05:31.916 --> 00:05:35.166
not from fulfilling the mind's desires,

109
00:05:35.166 --> 00:05:38.958
but from reducing

110
00:05:38.958 --> 00:05:41.125
the mind's desires.

111
00:05:41.125 --> 00:05:44.958
When you stop your mind from wandering

112
00:05:44.958 --> 00:05:46.791
in the search for material cravings

113
00:05:46.791 --> 00:05:49.083
and successes,

114
00:05:49.083 --> 00:05:54.500
only then is deep peace experienced.

115
00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:57.250
All this won't happen immediately.

116
00:05:57.250 --> 00:06:01.500
Only with patience, dedication,
 and continuous practice

117
00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:05.250
can the mind be calmed.

118
00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:07.708
But as you progress in this practice,

119
00:06:07.708 --> 00:06:11.125
you'll start experiencing

120
00:06:11.125 --> 00:06:14.958
such happiness

121
00:06:14.958 --> 00:06:17.541
that is far superior

122
00:06:17.541 --> 00:06:20.458
to any material pleasure

123
00:06:20.458 --> 00:06:22.458
and also permanent.

124
00:06:27.291 --> 00:06:30.416
For family happiness, a person

125
00:06:30.416 --> 00:06:35.000
works hard and earns money,

126
00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:40.250
so that all facilities can be 
available to the family.

127
00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:42.750
But if happiness was based

128
00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:45.416
only on wealth

129
00:06:45.416 --> 00:06:48.750
and facilities,

130
00:06:48.750 --> 00:06:50.333
then every wealthy person's family

131
00:06:50.333 --> 00:06:54.458
in the world would be blissful.

132
00:06:54.458 --> 00:06:57.000
But this is not so.

133
00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:59.583
Wealth and facilities

134
00:06:59.583 --> 00:07:02.541
are necessary for living,

135
00:07:02.541 --> 00:07:07.083
but considering them the main 
means of family happiness

136
00:07:07.083 --> 00:07:09.416
would be a mistake.

137
00:07:09.416 --> 00:07:11.083
Real happiness comes not from 

138
00:07:11.083 --> 00:07:15.208
material things or fulfillment of desires,

139
00:07:15.208 --> 00:07:20.875
but from mutual love and peace of mind.

140
00:07:20.875 --> 00:07:26.458
When the mind is calm, then 
even small things give joy:

141
00:07:26.458 --> 00:07:31.791
eating with the family, sitting together 
and having some discussion,

142
00:07:31.791 --> 00:07:39.458
some laughter and fun, or just a 
few peaceful moments spent together.

143
00:07:39.458 --> 00:07:45.166
But on the other hand, if the mind
 is filled with desires and worries,

144
00:07:45.166 --> 00:07:49.583
then even the biggest 
celebration will seem incomplete.

145
00:07:49.583 --> 00:07:52.750
Happiness is based not on external things

146
00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:57.166
but on your mental state.

147
00:07:57.166 --> 00:07:59.958
Joy will remain stable in the family

148
00:07:59.958 --> 00:08:05.250
only when love, respect, and peace remain there.

149
00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:07.625
Material facilities are necessary,

150
00:08:07.625 --> 00:08:10.375
but more important than them

151
00:08:10.375 --> 00:08:12.625
is a pleasant environment.

152
00:08:12.625 --> 00:08:15.625
And if the mind is calm,

153
00:08:15.625 --> 00:08:20.708
it will automatically create 
such an environment.

154
00:08:20.708 --> 00:08:25.583
Happiness will come into the family automatically.

155
00:08:25.583 --> 00:08:29.125
Therefore, for family happiness,

156
00:08:29.125 --> 00:08:32.125
collection of love among each other

157
00:08:32.125 --> 00:08:34.916
and collection of peace in the mind

158
00:08:34.916 --> 00:08:39.583
is more necessary than 
collection of things in the house.

159
00:08:44.166 --> 00:08:47.333
In professional life,

160
00:08:47.333 --> 00:08:50.291
often a person considers salary, promotion,

161
00:08:50.291 --> 00:08:53.500
or fulfillment of professional goals

162
00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:56.875
as the standard of happiness.

163
00:08:56.875 --> 00:08:59.541
But real happiness comes

164
00:08:59.541 --> 00:09:02.416
not only from professional achievements,

165
00:09:02.416 --> 00:09:07.208
but from complete balance of life –

166
00:09:07.208 --> 00:09:10.000
where material advancement

167
00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:14.250
and spiritual development go together.

168
00:09:14.250 --> 00:09:18.000
Many times a person gets stuck

169
00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:20.750
in such circumstances at their workplace

170
00:09:20.750 --> 00:09:23.333
that escaping from them seems impossible.

171
00:09:23.333 --> 00:09:25.750
Even after all efforts,

172
00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:29.000
no solution is visible.

173
00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:32.583
But then suddenly some path emerges,

174
00:09:32.583 --> 00:09:35.166
some such opportunity appears

175
00:09:35.166 --> 00:09:38.083
that was far beyond

176
00:09:38.083 --> 00:09:41.125
their planned thinking.

177
00:09:41.125 --> 00:09:42.500
These are the very moments

178
00:09:42.500 --> 00:09:45.291
when some such power

179
00:09:45.291 --> 00:09:48.291
is supporting you

180
00:09:48.291 --> 00:09:50.708
that is above your plans,

181
00:09:50.708 --> 00:09:53.541
above your thinking.

182
00:09:53.541 --> 00:09:57.166
Similarly, looking at the past too,

183
00:09:57.166 --> 00:10:01.250
you'll find many such circumstances

184
00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:05.375
where you thought failure was the end,

185
00:10:05.375 --> 00:10:10.166
but that same failure showed you the right path.

186
00:10:10.166 --> 00:10:13.708
Only if your mind is calm

187
00:10:13.708 --> 00:10:18.916
can you recognize this divine intervention.

188
00:10:18.916 --> 00:10:20.208
And then gratitude will awaken

189
00:10:20.208 --> 00:10:23.958
for every circumstance.

190
00:10:23.958 --> 00:10:27.916
Whatever the results, whatever the problem,

191
00:10:27.916 --> 00:10:30.958
you'll start understanding

192
00:10:30.958 --> 00:10:34.791
that this is not the end, just a milestone,

193
00:10:34.791 --> 00:10:38.000
and happiness is nearby.

194
00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:40.958
This is real balance.

195
00:10:40.958 --> 00:10:43.291
And this will only be attained

196
00:10:43.291 --> 00:10:45.208
when you view life

197
00:10:45.208 --> 00:10:48.625
from a spiritual perspective.

198
00:10:48.625 --> 00:10:51.000
Then you'll know

199
00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:55.250
that my blessing is upon you

200
00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:58.500
every moment.

201
00:10:58.500 --> 00:11:00.291
And this very perspective

202
00:11:00.291 --> 00:11:05.125
will make you experience 
deep peace and contentment,

203
00:11:05.125 --> 00:11:08.458
which is far more valuable

204
00:11:08.458 --> 00:11:11.583
than any professional achievement.
